msgstr "| `--enable-return-routed-experts` | MoE 路由器重放 | 返回编码后的专家路由决策 |"

msgid ""
"For the Ascend-specific option definitions, see\n"
"[Additional Configuration](../configuration/additional_config.md) and\n"
"[Environment Variables](../configuration/env_vars.md)."
msgstr ""
"有关 Ascend "
"特定的选项定义，请参阅[附加配置](../configuration/additional_config.md)和[环境变量](../configuration/env_vars.md)。"

msgid "## Trace Replay"
msgstr "## 轨迹回放"

msgid ""
"Trace replay forces the engine to emit a predetermined token sequence during\n"
"decoding while computing real logprobs from the model's unmodified logit\n"
"distribution. It is only supported by model runner V2. When using the normal\n"
"`vllm serve` command with the token-in/token-out endpoint, explicitly enable\n"
"model runner V2 and the scale-out endpoints:"
msgstr ""
"轨迹回放会强制引擎在解码期间输出预定的 token 序列，同时基于模型未经修改的 logit 分布计算真实的 logprobs。该功能仅由 model "
"runner V2 支持。当使用普通的 `vllm serve` 命令配合 token-in/token-out 端点时，需显式启用 model "
"runner V2 以及 scale-out 端点："

msgid ""
"The output tokens will always be `[15, 284, 1026, 374]`. The logprobs "
"reflect the model's true probability for each forced token under the current"
" inference configuration."
msgstr ""
"输出的 token 将始终为 `[15, 284, 1026, 374]`。logprobs 反映的是在当前推理配置下，模型对每个强制 token "
"的真实概率。"

msgid ""
"| `--enable-trace-replay` | trace replay | Forces decoding to follow a "
"predetermined token sequence |"
msgstr "| `--enable-trace-replay` | 轨迹回放 | 强制解码遵循预定的 token 序列 |"

msgid ""
"1. initialize the transfer engine;\n"
"2. pause generation;\n"
"3. start the weight update;\n"
"4. transfer one or more groups of weights;\n"
"5. finish the weight update;\n"
"6. resume generation."
msgstr ""
"1. 初始化传输引擎；\n"
"2. 暂停生成；\n"
"3. 开始权重更新；\n"
"4. 传输一组或多组权重；\n"
"5. 完成权重更新；\n"
"6. 恢复生成。"

msgid ""
"vLLM-Ascend exposes the following Ascend-specific weight-transfer backends:"
msgstr "vLLM-Ascend 提供以下昇腾专用的权重传输后端："

msgid ""
"| `sparse_hccl` | Replace selected checkpoint weight values on separate NPUs"
" | HCCL collectives |"
msgstr "| `sparse_hccl` | 在独立 NPU 上替换选定的检查点权重值 | HCCL 集合通信 |"

msgid ""
"The table describes transport choices. Sparse transfer requires the trainer and\n"
"rollout engine to start from the same checkpoint."
msgstr ""
"该表描述了传输方式的选择。稀疏传输要求训练器和\n"
"推理引擎从相同的检查点启动。"

msgid "The repository contains runnable examples for weight transfer:"
msgstr "仓库中包含可运行的权重传输示例："

msgid ""
"- [`rlhf_http_hccl.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/rl/rlhf_http_hccl.py)\n"
"- [`rlhf_http_npu_ipc.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/rl/rlhf_http_npu_ipc.py)\n"
"- [`rlhf_async_new_apis.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/rl/rlhf_async_new_apis.py)\n"
"- [`rlhf_sparse_hccl.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/182ea0448550a970e4f0ae3624fe35e38b37bc80/examples/rl/rlhf_sparse_hccl.py)"
msgstr ""
"- [`rlhf_http_hccl.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/rl/rlhf_http_hccl.py)\n"
"- [`rlhf_http_npu_ipc.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/rl/rlhf_http_npu_ipc.py)\n"
"- [`rlhf_async_new_apis.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/main/examples/rl/rlhf_async_new_apis.py)\n"
"- [`rlhf_sparse_hccl.py`](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm-ascend/blob/182ea0448550a970e4f0ae3624fe35e38b37bc80/examples/rl/rlhf_sparse_hccl.py)"

msgid "#### Sparse HCCL"
msgstr "#### 稀疏 HCCL"

msgid ""
"For sparse checkpoint updates, follow the upstream [Sparse NCCL\n"
"guide](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/training/weight_transfer/nccl/#sparse-nccl)\n"
"for patch semantics and the update lifecycle. On Ascend, select `sparse_hccl`\n"
"and enable RL mode:"
msgstr ""
"对于稀疏检查点更新，请参阅上游 [Sparse NCCL\n"
"指南](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/training/weight_transfer/nccl/#sparse-nccl)\n"
"了解补丁语义和更新生命周期。在昇腾上，选择 `sparse_hccl`\n"
"并启用 RL 模式："

msgid ""
"Run `rlhf_sparse_hccl.py` to initialize the trainer and send sparse checkpoint\n"
"updates. Its TP2 launch commands explicitly enable expert parallelism. Reserve\n"
"a separate NPU for the trainer; the transfer group size is `1 + TP * DP`, with\n"
"no additional EP factor. Pipeline parallelism is currently unsupported."
msgstr ""
"运行 `rlhf_sparse_hccl.py` 以初始化训练器并发送稀疏检查点\n"
"更新。其 TP2 启动命令显式启用专家并行。请为训练器预留\n"
"独立的 NPU；传输组大小为 `1 + TP * DP`，\n"
"不包含额外的 EP 因子。目前不支持流水线并行。"

msgid ""
"Sparse HCCL requires unquantized ND weights and static expert placement with\n"
"EPLB disabled. FRACTAL_NZ, fused MC2 expert weight lists, draft models, and packed\n"
"sparse updates are unsupported. Updates apply in place: after a failed update,\n"
"keep generation paused until the baseline is restored or the engine restarts."
msgstr ""
"稀疏 HCCL 要求使用未量化的 ND 权重，并采用静态专家放置且\n"
"禁用 EPLB。不支持 FRACTAL_NZ、融合 MC2 专家权重列表、草稿模型以及打包\n"
"稀疏更新。更新为原地应用：更新失败后，\n"
"请保持生成暂停，直到基线恢复或引擎重启。"

msgid "### Sampling Mask (Distribution Replay)"
msgstr "### 采样掩码（分布回放）"

msgid ""
"During RL rollout inference, top-k/top-p/min-p sampling truncates the model's\n"
"distribution. Sampling Mask returns the retained token IDs for each generated\n"
"position, so training can normalize policy probabilities over the same support\n"
"used during rollout. See the upstream\n"
"[Sampling Mask (Distribution Replay) guide](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/training/sampling_mask/)\n"
"for training-side usage."
msgstr ""
"在 RL rollout 推理过程中，top-k/top-p/min-p 采样会截断模型的\n"
"分布。采样掩码会返回每个生成位置保留的 token ID，\n"
"以便训练时在与 rollout 相同的支撑集上归一化策略概率。\n"
"训练侧用法请参阅上游\n"
"[采样掩码（分布回放）指南](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/training/sampling_mask/)。"

msgid ""
"`--return-sampling-mask` enables the feature and is disabled by default.\n"
"Model runner V2 and `--logprobs-mode processed_logprobs` are required.\n"
"The following example also uses `--tokens-only` to expose the token-in/token-out\n"
"API and skip tokenizer initialization. Use `--enable-scale-out` instead to expose the\n"
"same endpoint while retaining the normal serving setup and tokenizer.\n"
"See [Tokens in, tokens out](#tokens-in-tokens-out) for serving details."
msgstr ""
"`--return-sampling-mask` 用于启用该功能，默认处于禁用状态。\n"
"需要 Model runner V2 和 `--logprobs-mode processed_logprobs`。\n"
"以下示例还使用了 `--tokens-only` 以暴露 token-in/token-out\n"
"API 并跳过分词器初始化。若要在保留常规服务配置和分词器的同时暴露\n"
"同一端点，请改用 `--enable-scale-out`。\n"
"服务详情请参阅 [Tokens in, tokens out](#tokens-in-tokens-out)。"

msgid ""
"With sampling-mask capture enabled, requests must use\n"
"`temperature > 0` and `top_k > 0`. Send pre-tokenized input to\n"
"`/inference/v1/generate`:"
msgstr ""
"启用采样掩码捕获后，请求必须使用\n"
"`temperature > 0` 和 `top_k > 0`。将预分词输入发送到\n"
"`/inference/v1/generate`："

msgid ""
"Each choice returns one support set per generated token. The following tested\n"
"Qwen3-0.6B response excerpt omits metadata, ranks, and `top_logprobs`:"
msgstr ""
"每个 choice 为每个生成的 token 返回一个支撑集。以下经过测试的\n"
"Qwen3-0.6B 响应摘录省略了元数据、rank 和 `top_logprobs`："

msgid ""
"Basic distribution replay needs the complete mask and the sampled token's old\n"
"logprob. During training, apply the saved mask to the current policy's logits\n"
"to compute that token's new logprob. Old logprobs for every candidate token are\n"
"not required."
msgstr ""
"基本的分布回放需要完整的掩码以及被采样 token 的旧\n"
"logprob。训练时，将保存的掩码应用于当前策略的 logits\n"
"以计算该 token 的新 logprob。无需为每个候选 token 保存\n"
"旧 logprob。"

msgid ""
"The sampled token belongs to its corresponding support. Mask size is independent\n"
"of `logprobs`, and top-k ties can retain more than `top_k` tokens. With\n"
"`stream=true`, concatenate token and mask chunks by choice index and token\n"
"position."
msgstr ""
"被采样的 token 属于其对应的支撑集。掩码大小与\n"
"`logprobs` 无关，且 top-k 并列时可能保留超过 `top_k` 个 token。当\n"
"`stream=true` 时，请按 choice 索引和 token 位置拼接 token 与掩码\n"
"分块。"

msgid ""
"For an MTP-capable model, speculative decoding is supported with fixed\n"
"verification boundaries. Add the following configuration to the server command:"
msgstr ""
"对于支持 MTP 的模型，支持具有固定\n"
"验证边界的投机解码。将以下配置添加到服务器命令中："

msgid ""
"Each committed token receives the processed target-model support at its\n"
"position. The mask does not record draft or acceptance probabilities."
msgstr ""
"每个已提交的 token 都会在其位置获得处理后的目标模型支撑集。\n"
"掩码不记录草稿概率或接受概率。"

msgid ""
"On Ascend, supports are packed on the NPU and decoded on the CPU using the\n"
"exact bitmask fallback. This preserves the complete support but adds transfer,\n"
"CPU decoding, and response-size overhead. The adapter requires the upstream\n"
"request-major sampling-mask interface."
msgstr ""
"在昇腾上，支撑集在 NPU 上打包，并使用精确位掩码回退在 CPU 上\n"
"解码。这保留了完整的支撑集，但会增加传输、\n"
"CPU 解码和响应大小的开销。该适配器需要上游的\n"
"request-major 采样掩码接口。"

msgid ""
"Diffusion models, custom logits processors, adaptive verification, and the\n"
"batch-sharded LM-head gather path are not supported for this feature.\n"
"Sampling masks contain neither probability values nor RNG state; they do not\n"
"force a token sequence as [Trace Replay](#trace-replay) does."
msgstr ""
"此功能不支持扩散模型、自定义 logits 处理器、自适应验证以及\n"
"批次分片的 LM-head gather 路径。\n"
"采样掩码既不包含概率值也不包含 RNG 状态；它不会像\n"
"[Trace Replay](#trace-replay) 那样强制 token 序列。"

msgid ""
"The experimental token-in/token-out (TITO) endpoint accepts pre-tokenized\n"
"prompts and, by default (`output_mode=\"tokens\"`), returns generated token IDs.\n"
"Apply tokenization and any chat template on the client before sending\n"
"`token_ids`. Choose one of two serving modes:"
msgstr ""
"实验性的 token-in/token-out (TITO) 端点接受预分词的\n"
"提示，并默认（`output_mode=\"tokens\"`）返回生成的 token ID。\n"
"在发送 `token_ids` 之前，请在客户端完成分词和任何聊天模板的\n"
"应用。请选择以下两种服务模式之一："

msgid ""
"`--tokens-only` uses token output and does not support stop strings; use\n"
"`sampling_params.stop_token_ids` instead. A normal server started without\n"
"either flag returns HTTP 403 for TITO requests, with a message to enable\n"
"`--enable-scale-out`."
msgstr ""
"`--tokens-only` 使用 token 输出，不支持停止字符串；请改用\n"
"`sampling_params.stop_token_ids`。未使用任一标志启动的普通服务器\n"
"对 TITO 请求返回 HTTP 403，并提示启用\n"
"`--enable-scale-out`。"

msgid "Send a non-streaming request to `/inference/v1/generate`:"
msgstr "向 `/inference/v1/generate` 发送非流式请求："

msgid ""
"The following non-streaming response excerpt illustrates the structure for a\n"
"request that reaches the two-token limit. Token IDs and logprob values are\n"
"illustrative, not captured model output; other response fields are omitted:"
msgstr ""
"以下非流式响应摘录展示了达到两个 token 上限的请求的\n"
"结构。Token ID 和 logprob 值仅为示意，并非实际捕获的模型输出；\n"
"其他响应字段已省略："

msgid ""
"In token output mode, `choices[].logprobs.content` contains an integer\n"
"`token_id`, its `logprob` and `rank`, and `top_logprobs` for each generated\n"
"position. Non-streaming responses include `usage` without requiring\n"
"`stream_options.include_usage`. Here, three prompt tokens and two completion\n"
"tokens give five total tokens; `stop_reason` is `null` because generation\n"
"reached `max_tokens`."
msgstr ""
"在 token 输出模式下，`choices[].logprobs.content` 为每个生成位置包含一个整数\n"
"`token_id`、其 `logprob` 和 `rank`，以及 `top_logprobs`。\n"
"非流式响应包含 `usage`，无需设置\n"
"`stream_options.include_usage`。此处三个提示 token 和两个补全\n"
"token 共计五个 token；`stop_reason` 为 `null`，因为生成\n"
"达到了 `max_tokens`。"

msgid ""
"Set `stream=true` to receive server-sent events (SSE), ending with\n"
"`data: [DONE]`. To cancel an in-flight request, send a POST to\n"
"`/inference/v1/abort_requests` with a JSON body containing `request_ids`, a\n"
"list of IDs returned by the server (including the `generate-tokens-` prefix),\n"
"rather than the original client-supplied IDs."
msgstr ""
"设置 `stream=true` 以接收服务器发送事件（SSE），并以\n"
"`data: [DONE]` 结束。要取消正在进行的请求，请向\n"
"`/inference/v1/abort_requests` 发送 POST 请求，JSON 请求体包含 `request_ids`，即\n"
"服务器返回的 ID 列表（包括 `generate-tokens-` 前缀），\n"
"而不是客户端最初提供的 ID。"

msgid ""
"For the full protocol and the `text` output mode, which requires a tokenizer,\n"
"see the upstream\n"
"[TITO guide](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/serving/online_serving/token_in_token_out/).\n"
"The [Tokens API RFC](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/22817)\n"
"provides design background."
msgstr ""
"有关完整协议以及需要分词器的 `text` 输出模式，\n"
"请参阅上游\n"
"[TITO 指南](https://docs.vllm.ai/en/latest/serving/online_serving/token_in_token_out/)。\n"
"[Tokens API RFC](https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/issues/22817)\n"
"提供了设计背景。"

msgid ""
"`VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1` prevents the server from falling back to model\n"
"runner V1, which is incompatible with trace replay.\n"
"`--enable-scale-out` registers the\n"
"`/inference/v1/generate` endpoint for a normal serving process.\n"
"`--enable-trace-replay` opts the server into accepting trace replay requests."
msgstr ""
"`VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1` 可防止服务器回退到模型\n"
"运行器 V1，因为 V1 与 trace replay 不兼容。\n"
"`--enable-scale-out` 为普通服务进程注册\n"
"`/inference/v1/generate` 端点。\n"
"`--enable-trace-replay` 使服务器选择接受 trace replay 请求。"

msgid ""
"| `--return-sampling-mask` | Sampling Mask (Distribution Replay) | Return "
"the support set for each generated token; disabled by default |"
msgstr "| `--return-sampling-mask` | 采样掩码（分布回放） | 返回每个生成 token 的支持集；默认禁用 |"

msgid ""
"| `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1` | Sampling Mask and Trace Replay | Select the"
" model runner V2 implementation required by both features |"
msgstr ""
"| `VLLM_USE_V2_MODEL_RUNNER=1` | 采样掩码与 trace replay | 选择这两个功能所需的模型运行器 V2 实现 "
"|"

msgid ""
"| `--enable-scale-out` | Token-in/token-out requests on a normal server | "
"Register `/inference/v1/generate`; `--tokens-only` also registers this "
"endpoint |"
msgstr ""
"| `--enable-scale-out` | 普通服务器上的 token 输入/token 输出请求 | 注册 "
"`/inference/v1/generate`；`--tokens-only` 也会注册此端点 |"
